---
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
---

<>
<section class="w-full flex-center mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="w-full col-center gap-14 max-w-6xl my-14 md:my-16 lg:my-20">
        <div class="col-center gap-2">
            <h2 class="h2-bold text-center fade-in-up">
                Why Warehouster for Asset Management?
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug text-gray-500 max-w-5xl text-justify md:text-center px-auto pt-4 fade-in-up">
                Choosing the right partner for managing warehousing investments can make all the difference between average performance and exceptional long-term growth. At Warehouster, we go beyond basic property management to deliver comprehensive asset management solutions that maximize value, reduce risks, and ensure consistent returns. Our expertise lies in blending institutional-grade processes with local market insights, enabling us to manage every stage of the investment lifecycle with precision and transparency.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full col-center gap-4 md:gap-5">
            <div class="w-full flex-stretch gap-4 md:gap-5 fade-in-up">
                <div class="w-full md:w-3/5 py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-[#dcdcdc] rounded-xl">
                    <div class="w-full flex justify-end pb-7">
                        <div class="w-14 md:w-20 lg:w-24 p-2 aspect-square rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-(--secondary-color)">
                            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-(--primary-color) flex-center">
                                <Image src="/icons/asset-manag-icon-1.webp" alt="asset-manag-icon-1" width={60} height={60} class="w-[55%]" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
                        <h3 class="h3-md pb-2.5 md:pb-3 lg:pb-4">
                            Superior Capital Return
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-base lg:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-500">
                            We specialize in maximizing ROI. From acquisition through development, operations, and exit, we structure and manage all touchpoints for value creation.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full md:w-2/5 py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-[#dcdcdc] rounded-xl">
                    <div class="w-full flex justify-end pb-7">
                        <div class="w-14 md:w-20 lg:w-24 p-2 aspect-square rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-(--secondary-color)">
                            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-(--primary-color) flex-center">
                                <Image src="/icons/asset-manag-icon-2.webp" alt="asset-manag-icon-2" width={60} height={60} class="w-[55%]" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
                        <h3 class="h3-md pb-2.5 md:pb-3 lg:pb-4">
                            Deep Local Market Knowledge
                        </h3>
                        <p class="lg:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-500">
                            Having developed and managed warehousing parks in Chennai, Bengaluru, Madurai, and Hosur gives us first‐hand regional intelligence. We understand land acquisition, compliance, labor, and logistics in depth.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full flex-stretch gap-4 md:gap-5 fade-in-up">
                <div class="w-full md:w-[33%] py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-[#dcdcdc] rounded-xl">
                    <div class="w-full flex justify-end pb-7">
                        <div class="w-14 md:w-20 lg:w-24 p-2 aspect-square rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-(--secondary-color)">
                            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-(--primary-color) flex-center">
                                <Image src="/icons/asset-manag-icon-3.webp" alt="asset-manag-icon-3" width={60} height={60} class="w-[55%]" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
                        <h3 class="h3-md pb-2.5 md:pb-3 lg:pb-4">
                            Foreign Capital Structuring & Partnerships
                        </h3>
                        <p class="lg:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-500">
                            If you're bringing in capital from abroad, you'll benefit from our experience in fund‐management, cross‐border investment, and risk mitigation.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full md:w-[33%] py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-[#dcdcdc] rounded-xl">
                    <div class="w-full flex justify-end pb-7">
                        <div class="w-14 md:w-20 lg:w-24 p-2 aspect-square rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-(--secondary-color)">
                            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-(--primary-color) flex-center">
                                <Image src="/icons/asset-manag-icon-4.webp" alt="asset-manag-icon-4" width={60} height={60} class="w-[55%]" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
                        <h3 class="h3-md pb-2.5 md:pb-3 lg:pb-4">
                            Rigorous Institutional Processes
                        </h3>
                        <p class="lg:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-500">
                            We apply robust governance, transparent reporting, and standardized operations to ensure investor confidence.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full md:w-[33%] py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-[#dcdcdc] rounded-xl">
                    <div class="w-full flex justify-end pb-7">
                        <div class="w-14 md:w-20 lg:w-24 p-2 aspect-square rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-(--secondary-color)">
                            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-(--primary-color) flex-center">
                                <Image src="/icons/asset-manag-icon-5.webp" alt="asset-manag-icon-5" width={60} height={60} class="w-[55%]" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
                        <h3 class="h3-md pb-2.5 md:pb-3 lg:pb-4">
                            Advanced Analytics & Research
                        </h3>
                        <p class="lg:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-500">
                            Data‐driven decision-making market demand forecasting, utilization rates, cost optimization, cap‐ex planning, and continuous performance monitoring.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
</>

